  "title": "packaging: Exclude Stratoshark related files from main wireshark package",
  "description": "Don't pick up the binaries or man pages in the main wireshark package that\nare already included in the stratoshark package. They don't need to be\nin both packages.\n\nInclude strato in the Stratoshark package if built (there should be a new\n--with option to handle the case of building strato without Stratoshark,\nI suppose.)",
