        {
          "id": 2781650794,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "This does still leave the main wireshark package depending on `libsinsp` (through `falcosecurity-libs`) if stratoshark is built, because of the `falco-events` plugin.\n\n@geraldcombs - Currently all plugins, including `falco-events`, are placed in the `wireshark/plugins` directory, and `wsutil/CMakeLists.txt` doesn't define a separate stratoshark plugins directory the way is done for extcaps. Eventually should there be a separate stratoshark plugin directory?",
